{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03018.SBN#0001", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03018.SBN", "offset": 221, "capacity": 42, "raw_hex": "f0b0f0b1f8e1f177f16bf157f7d12f2ff3d5fac3f2b7f157f18d81432f2ff18efa63f46ef0a4f0f081b8", "baseline_text": "칸나의 광무는…//처음 봤는데，//정말 멋지네∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "カンナの光武って……//はじめて見たけど、//すごくかっこいいね！", "pointer_offset": 192, "unit": "dialogue:990b32be422518cc", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03018.SBN#0002", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03018.SBN", "offset": 284, "capacity": 44, "raw_hex": "f0d8f14381482f2ff2e8f8a4f144f0bcf944f29af8aff154f15af14781432f2ff16bf559f8a4f287f0af8148", "baseline_text": "그래？//왠지 가시가 돋아 있어서，//무섭지 않아？", "kind": "ascr", "source": "そうかい？//なんかトゲトゲしてて、//怖くないかい？", "pointer_offset": 196, "unit": "dialogue:a26a474a2b89f6be", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03018.SBN#0003", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03018.SBN", "offset": 335, "capacity": 54, "raw_hex": "f0aff0b88143f0d8f27ef8a4f287f0af81442f2ff0b5f0b6f1b28143f2e8f0a4f7d12f2ff28bf2a3f9a9f0bdf3d1f8b2f1daf15af7d1", "baseline_text": "아니，그렇지 않아．//오히려，왠지…//따뜻한 느낌이 들어…", "kind": "ascr", "source": "ううん、そんなことないよ。//逆に、なんだか、//あったかい感じがするよ……", "pointer_offset": 200, "unit": "dialogue:406446b6e25a9234", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03018.SBN#0004", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03018.SBN", "offset": 408, "capacity": 44, "raw_hex": "fa80f271f272f29ef0a4f1d481432f2ff0b0f8b1f3b2f8b9f154f0a2f1c781432f2ff191f36cf8b2f2678144", "baseline_text": "잘 모르겠지만，//칸나 곁에 있으면，//안심이 돼．", "kind": "ascr", "source": "よくわからないけど、//カンナのそばにいると、//安心できるんだ。", "pointer_offset": 204, "unit": "dialogue:f4f94f971505e2be", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03018.SBN#0005", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03018.SBN", "offset": 471, "capacity": 64, "raw_hex": "f14ff9cef1cff8f3f263f8c8f94bf1e2f276f0af81b82f2ff0d8f2ca8143f14ef17bf8f3f46ef951f271f0cef0c82f2ff1acf9bef265f148f29ef157f2e181b8", "baseline_text": "기분 좋은 말을 해 주잖아∈//그럼，조금은 멋진 모습을//보여 줘야겠는걸∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "うれしいこといってくれるぜ！//じゃあ、ちょっとはイイトコ//見せないといけねぇな！", "pointer_offset": 208, "unit": "dialogue:74ce9fcde53b8bf2", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03018.SBN#0006", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03018.SBN", "offset": 552, "capacity": 40, "raw_hex": "f3a881b82f2ff0b0f0b1f8e1f144f0a8faaff57081432f2ff14ff0e2f0a5f984f154f0c8f0f181b8", "baseline_text": "응∈//칸나의 가라테 쇼，//기대하고 있을게∈", "kind": "ascr", "source": "うん！//カンナのカラテショー、//期待してるよ∈", "pointer_offset": 212, "unit": "dialogue:bf6a21fe84f7bddf", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
{"id": "SLG/G03/E/EV03018.SBN#0007", "file": "SLG/G03/E/EV03018.SBN", "offset": 599, "capacity": 4, "raw_hex": "6d61696e", "baseline_text": "main", "kind": "ascr", "source": "main", "pointer_offset": 216, "unit": "dialogue:0d6e4079e36703eb", "prior_review": "교차 검토 필요"}
